window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>She vowed to bring about an end to the Society. But it may destroy her first.</p> <p>The Society can't seem to catch a break, and Jo has had enough of it. She can destroy anything with her magic. So why not the Society itself?</p> <p>Her pursuit of freedom has Jo questioning everything, from what the Society really is to how it was formed and what does she really feel for their mysterious leader. With the unexpected help of an android serial killer and the silence of her fellow teammates, she'll get her answers. But Jo is not be prepared for what she learns.</p> <p>As her relationship with Snow deepens from the truth finally being revealed, so, too, does her worry for the fates of all those she loves. </p> <p>When you're the key to bringing about the end of the world, nowhere is safe.</p> <p><i>Birth of Chaos</i> is a full-length fantasy/paranormal romance novel that's the third book in the Wish Quartet, a four-book series that establishes the Age of Magic universe. It's perfect for listeners who love time travel, twisty, slow-burn stories, as well as steamy (sexy) romance.</p>"; 
